<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-RAIN WASHES OUT SECOND DAY OF FOURTH TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RAIN WASHES OUT SECOND DAY OF FOURTH TEST.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Play on the second day</p>
<p>of the fourth test between West Indies and India was abandoned</p>
<p>without a ball being bowled on Saturday due to heavy overnight</p>
<p>rain.</p>
<p>With persistent showers througout the day, prospects of play</p>
<p>on Sunday also look remote.</p>
</text>
